  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1: Three asciidoctor-parity parser fixes. Recognise `-` as a first-level unordered list marker (alongside `*`). Treat empty entries in table `cols=\"...\"` specs as default-spec columns instead of dropping them, preserving the row/column mapping. Join continuation lines into the preceding cell so multi-line content — including a `footnote:[…]` macro whose closing `]` lands on the next physical line inside an `a|` AsciiDoc cell — is parsed correctly. See CHANGELOG.md.",
